  "about_item": [
    "Natural Plant-Based Formula, Family-Friendly Protection: Choose gentle natural flea and tick prevention for dogs to protect your furry friends without worries. Different from harsh chemical dog flea and tick treatment that may irritate dog skin, our flea and tick pendant is made of pure natural plant essential oils with no toxic additives. It is safe for dogs, kids and other pets at home, allowing close daily interaction without health risks.",
    "Water & Weather Resistant, Works Great Indoor & Outdoor: Built with durable waterproof and weatherproof material, our practical flea and tick collar for dogs delivers steady pest-repelling performance in all scenarios. Whether your dog stays inside the house, or plays outdoors in rain, snow, high humidity and hot weather, our effective tick collar will not lose its repellent effect easily, suitable for daily walking, hiking and backyard activities.",
    "Long-Lasting Slow Release Effect, Stable Daily Protection: Adopts professional slow-release essential oil technology to provide continuous all-day protection. This premium dog flea collar and powerful tick repellent keeps repelling fleas, ticks and other annoying pests for months. You don’t need frequent replacement, bringing long-term and hassle-free flea and tick prevention for your lovely pets.",
    "Universal Fit for All Collars & All Dog Breeds, Easy to Use: Super easy installation with no complicated steps required. Just hang this lightweight dog flea and tick collar pendant tag directly on your dog’s existing collar, and it fits all other brands of dog collars perfectly. COLLAR IS NOT INCLUDED. Besides, this universal pendant works well for small, medium, large dogs and all dog breeds, bringing no extra burden to your pets.",
    "Warm Usage Reminder, Better Using Experience: Note for first-time use: Please put it in a well-ventilated place for 3-5 days to dissipate the slight smell before attaching it to your dog’s collar. This small tip helps achieve better repellent performance while keeping your dog comfortable all the time."
  ],
